 "notes": [
  "Recovered records: 2850 records (all years) that the production prefilter labelled application but the full-abstract re-run labelled discourse or evaluative, stance-classified with the production v1 configuration; 3 stayed FAILED after one resubmission and 2453 with a valid stance are dated 2021-2025. In (a), columns 2 and 3 are retained and recovered records. Corpora: (a) production; (b) production plus recovered; (c) as (b) with recovered records weighted by the audit's full-abstract precision for their year; (d) the full-abstract prefilter's corpus (adds recovered records, drops 1587 production records whose full-abstract label is application). 95% percentile bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples, seed 42), joint resampling; (c) uses a frequency-weighted logistic model with HC0 SEs. Plotted in {{F:temporal_robustness_fig}}. Critical stance was Alarm or Caution.",
  "Version 2 (Batch 2d): every OR per year here comes from record-level logistic regression on publication year with journal cluster-robust SEs (95% CI and P from the cluster-robust covariance); point estimates are unchanged."
 ],
